<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - KeyCorp cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KeyCorp cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Josephthal Lyon &amp; Ross analyst Frank Barkocy said he cut KeyCorp to hold from buy solely on the basis of price</p>
<p>-- Analyst cites 26.4 pct rise in share price since July 23, 1996 when he issued buy recommendation</p>
<p>-- Analyst says company fundamentals attractive, estimates earnings of $3.75 per share in 1996, $4.13 in 1997</p>
<p>-- KeyCorp off 1/8 to 47-3/4 in late morning</p>
</text>
